{"5102690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fun, Cool, Sexy City Life", "steam_appid": 5102690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a part-time server at The Tavern, the only restaurant in Dome City that uses portal space! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique life in the futuristic city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the futuristic <strong>Dome City</strong>, <strong>The Tavern</strong> is the only restaurant built inside a portal space. Take a part-time job as a server and experience life on the other side of the portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your typing skills and keyboard to take orders from a variety of customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5102690/extras/2462ce725d242f0b37a21c89a84cf776.avif?t=1787803059\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5102690/extras_big/2462ce725d242f0b37a21c89a84cf776.avif?t=1787803059 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ring the bell to reduce the cooking time. Ring the bell to speed up cooking times. The more you ring it, the lower your health drops—but the more money you'll earn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5102690/extras/a717797a5a9f022c3906c1baf05f0286.avif?t=1787803059\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5102690/extras_big/a717797a5a9f022c3906c1baf05f0286.avif?t=1787803059 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve your guests </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5102690/extras/b912baa87b81da34e06c1a742151b184.avif?t=1787803059\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5102690/extras_big/b912baa87b81da34e06c1a742151b184.avif?t=1787803059 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and uncover seven short stories </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5102690/extras/494136f2cf6f7dab16f5d76d4c358cfc.avif?t=1787803059\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5102690/extras_big/494136f2cf6f7dab16f5d76d4c358cfc.avif?t=1787803059 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >exploring what makes life <strong>fun, cool, and sexy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short game, but a story I hope stays with you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a part-time server at The Tavern, the only restaurant in Dome City that uses portal space! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique life in the futuristic city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the futuristic <strong>Dome City</strong>, <strong>The Tavern</strong> is the only restaurant built inside a portal space. Take a part-time job as a server and experience life on the other side of the portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your typing skills and keyboard to take orders from a variety of customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5102690/extras/2462ce725d242f0b37a21c89a84cf776.avif?t=1787803059\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5102690/extras_big/2462ce725d242f0b37a21c89a84cf776.avif?t=1787803059 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ring the bell to reduce the cooking time. Ring the bell to speed up cooking times. The more you ring it, the lower your health drops—but the more money you'll earn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5102690/extras/a717797a5a9f022c3906c1baf05f0286.avif?t=1787803059\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5102690/extras_big/a717797a5a9f022c3906c1baf05f0286.avif?t=1787803059 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve your guests </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5102690/extras/b912baa87b81da34e06c1a742151b184.avif?t=1787803059\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5102690/extras_big/b912baa87b81da34e06c1a742151b184.avif?t=1787803059 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and uncover seven short stories </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5102690/extras/494136f2cf6f7dab16f5d76d4c358cfc.avif?t=1787803059\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5102690/extras_big/494136f2cf6f7dab16f5d76d4c358cfc.avif?t=1787803059 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >exploring what makes life <strong>fun, cool, and sexy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short game, but a story I hope stays with you.</p>", "short_description": "Work as a part-time server in a futuristic portal restaurant! In this typing-driven simulation game, test your speed and accuracy to take customer orders, balance your h